    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Oh, the fountain looks so sad now without the sparkly coins in it! I
        need to uncover this mystery and put it right! Like a proper detective would!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: The thief must have bought something here for sure! But why would a
        stolen coin get left behind?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2997701947782708253, guid: e16bce84171832e45a02c038e842c326, type: 3}
